<section class="sbs-panel sbs-tools" data-panel="mockups" id="sbs-photo-mockups" aria-label="Mock-ups">
 <div class="sbs-tools-inputs"><label class="sbs-button">Choose T-shirt photo / Browse tablet<input id="sbs-photo-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label><div><label for="sbs-photo-search">Search approved artwork</label><input id="sbs-photo-search" type="search" placeholder="Search artwork"><select id="sbs-photo-artwork" aria-label="Approved Studio artwork"><option value="">Choose artwork</option></select><button id="sbs-photo-refresh" class="sbs-button">Refresh artwork</button></div></div>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-photo-auto" class="sbs-button primary">Automatically fit artwork</button><label><input id="sbs-photo-cost" type="checkbox">Use paid AI photo analysis (provider usage charges apply)</label></div>
 <p id="sbs-photo-fit-result" class="sbs-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">AI fit has not run. Manual placement is available.</p>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-photo-fit-before" class="sbs-button" disabled>Before AI fit</button><button id="sbs-photo-fit-after" class="sbs-button" disabled>After AI fit</button><label><input id="sbs-photo-outline" type="checkbox" checked>Show AI outline</label></div>
 <div class="sbs-tool-view" id="sbs-photo-view"><canvas id="sbs-photo-canvas" width="800" height="800" aria-label="T-shirt mock-up; drag artwork to move or use a corner to resize"></canvas></div>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Drag mode<select id="sbs-photo-mode"><option value="move">Move / resize</option><option value="corners">Four-corner perspective</option><option value="pan">Pan view</option></select></label><button id="sbs-photo-left" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Rotate artwork left 2 degrees">↶ 2°</button><button id="sbs-photo-right" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Rotate artwork right 2 degrees">↷ 2°</button><button id="sbs-photo-reset" class="sbs-button">Fit / Reset</button><button id="sbs-photo-undo" class="sbs-button">Undo</button><label>Zoom<input id="sbs-photo-zoom" type="range" min="1" max="5" step="0.1" value="1"></label><button id="sbs-photo-download" class="sbs-button primary">Finish &amp; Download</button></div>
 <p id="sbs-photo-status" role="status">Choose a photo and artwork. Photos stay in this browser tab. Manual placement uses no AI.</p><p id="sbs-photo-qa" role="status">NOT FOR PRINTING — web / marketing photograph only.</p>
 <details><summary>Advanced</summary><label><input id="sbs-photo-lighting" type="checkbox" checked>Follow fabric lighting and folds</label><label>Photo enhancement provider<select id="sbs-photo-provider"><option value="openai">Auto — configured OpenAI</option></select></label><button id="sbs-photo-providers" class="sbs-button">Check available photo models</button><label>Optional photo instructions<input id="sbs-photo-instructions" type="text" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Optional lighting or scene refinement"></label><label><input id="sbs-photo-enhance-cost" type="checkbox">Use paid photo regeneration; the photo may change. Artwork is added afterwards.</label><div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-photo-enhance" class="sbs-button">Creative Photo Enhance</button><button id="sbs-photo-resume" class="sbs-button" hidden>Resume photo enhancement</button><button id="sbs-photo-cancel" class="sbs-button" hidden>Cancel photo enhancement</button><button id="sbs-photo-original" class="sbs-button">Restore original photo</button><button id="sbs-photo-closeup" class="sbs-button">Inspect graphic close-up</button></div><p id="sbs-photo-provider-status" role="status">Photo enhancement is optional. Compare results yourself; Auto is not a benchmark winner.</p><label>Browse tablet artwork<input id="sbs-photo-artfile" type="file" accept="image/png"></label><label>Web format<select id="sbs-photo-format"><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option><option value="image/webp">WebP</option></select></label><p>AI analyses the blank photo and suggests perspective and occlusions. Review folds and hidden areas yourself. The graphic is always composited from its original pixels; it is never generated. Provider choices are checked against the connected accounts. Your exact artwork is never sent to photo enhancement.</p></details>
</section>
